<title>UK: Reuters sixth ex-Miami air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters sixth ex-Miami air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average air freight rates from Miami International Airport to key destinations in Latin America and London.</p>
<p>					   Sept 16	 August 5</p>
<p>		     BRAZIL</p>
<p>MIA-SAO				   1.90		 2.00</p>
<p>		    COLOMBIA</p>
<p>MIA-BOG				   0.60		 0.63</p>
<p>		    ARGENTINA</p>
<p>MIA-BUE				   1.90		 2.00</p>
<p>			 EUROPE</p>
<p>MIA-LHR				   1.00		 1.00</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuter journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at or near Miami International airport.</p>
<p>* All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>* The tariffs represents average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
</text>
